  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7f2cadc6-7745-f4c1-286f-2c194cde8e10"],
 ":"
}], "Text",
 CellID->722614850,ExpressionUUID->"3ce605f7-78d4-0a4b-4513-f4c7c3754877"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"qpcKs", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"0.25", ",", " ", "0.5", ",", " ", "1.5"}], "}"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"qpcPanel", "[", "\[CurlyEpsilon]v_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"ks", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
         RowBox[{"qpcKs", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"N", "[", 
            RowBox[{"qpcSideEdge", "[", 
             RowBox[{"Rationalize", "[", "\[CurlyEpsilon]v", "]"}], "]"}], 
            "]"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"N", "[", 
           RowBox[{"qpcEP", "[", 
            RowBox[{"Rationalize", "[", "\[CurlyEpsilon]v", "]"}], "]"}], 
           "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"w", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
         RowBox[{"1", " ", "+", " ", 
          RowBox[{"\[CurlyEpsilon]v", "^", "2"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", 
     "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"Plot", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Evaluate", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"qpcSpec", " ", "/.", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]", " ", "->", " ", "1"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"\[CurlyEpsilon]", " ", "->", " ", "\[CurlyEpsilon]v"}], 
             ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"k", " ", "->", " ", "#"}]}], "}"}]}], " ", "&"}], " ", "/@",
          " ", "ks"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\[Omega]", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"-", "3"}], ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"PlotRange", " ", "->", " ", "All"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"GridLines", " ", "->", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"-", "w"}], ",", " ", "w"}], "}"}], ",", " ", "None"}], 
         "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"GridLinesStyle", " ", "->", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Directive", "[", 
         RowBox[{"Gray", ",", " ", "Dashed"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"FrameLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<\[Omega]/\[CapitalOmega]\>\"", ",", 
          " ", "\"\<\[CapitalOmega] S(\[Omega])\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n", 
       "    ", 
       RowBox[{"PlotLegends", " ", "->", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Placed", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"LineLegend", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"\"\<k/\[CapitalOmega] = \>\"", ",", " ", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"Round", "[", 
                   RowBox[{"#", ",", " ", "0.01"}], "]"}], " ", "/.", " ", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"x_Real", " ", "/;", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"x", " ", "==", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"Round", "[", "x", "]"}]}]}], " ", ":>", " ", 
                   RowBox[{"Round", "[", "x", "]"}]}]}]}], "}"}], "]"}], " ", 
              "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", "ks"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"LegendLayout", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"\"\<Row\>\"", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}], ",", 
          " ", "Below"}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"PlotLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          
          RowBox[{"\"\<\[CurlyEpsilon]/\[CapitalOmega] = \>\"", ",", " ", 
           "\[CurlyEpsilon]v"}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"ImageSize", " ", "->", " ", "300"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"PlotGrid", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"qpcPanel", " ", "/@", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "0.3", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"ImageSize", " ", "->", " ", "900"}]}], "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[21]:= ",
 CellID->310506612,ExpressionUUID->"75e65f9c-a6ea-c9cf-3792-f23bc9c56d81"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "On resonance the two peaks slide inward and meet at zero frequency at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["k", "TI"], "=", "\[CapitalOmega]", "/", 
   SqrtBox["2"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "094e4f7f-504c-3116-394c-65202ee33021"],
 ", while the eigenvectors of ",
 Cell[BoxData["\[ScriptCapitalL]"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7797bb49-d98c-2768-085e-452c40490dd6"],
 " coalesce only at the exceptional point ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["k", "TI"], "=", "\[CapitalOmega]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "14e1eac9-5187-6487-76f4-a4069bd0c43e"],
 ", where the spectrum has long shown one central peak. An offset raises the \
center of the spectrum and removes the side peaks at a smaller ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3586a490-62d2-6187-52ac-a1fe63e24775"],
 "; at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[Epsilon]", "/", "\[CapitalOmega]", "=", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "54c46459-6372-c61e-29ee-1a0bd464ceee"],
 " they vanish although no exceptional point exists at all, so the merging of \
the peaks is a property of the line shape, not of eigenvector coalescence."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1763150000,ExpressionUUID->"2566b678-ba55-70c0-0b5c-8de08352e561"],

Cell["\[NonBreakingSpace]", "SlideShowNavigationBar",
 CellTags->"SlideShowHeader",
 CellID->1603817993,ExpressionUUID->"46918177-025e-a82e-3be6-0fa5d6a6a925"],

Cell["Measurement, noise and estimation", "Section",
 CellID->56159645,ExpressionUUID->"0ab58725-52d1-4819-3fb8-12a61faeee18"],

Cell["\<\
The examples in this section follow a system while it is being measured. A \
qubit read out continuously jumps toward an eigenstate, purifies, and stays \
inside the Bloch ball; a trapped particle watched in position is squeezed \
below its zero-point width; a laser's phase diffuses. The same records drive \
a quantum Bayesian update, a Kalman filter that tracks five numbers instead \
of a wavefunction, feedback that protects a code, and the tracking of error \
syndromes. The section ends with what finite data can tell: a four-outcome \
measurement that fixes a qubit, tomography of states and processes, undoing a \
measurement while its record survives, randomized benchmarking, entanglement \
made by measurement alone, and whether a GHZ probe beats product probes when \
every qubit dephases. The models are stochastic master equations written as \
WL It\[OHat] and Stratonovich processes and sampled with RandomFunction, with \
QF supplying the operators, the measurements and the state estimates.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->2129249547,ExpressionUUID->"75435605-e35f-d6ef-069f-ee197ea1df8e"],

Cell["\[NonBreakingSpace]", "SlideShowNavigationBar",
 CellTags->"SlideShowHeader",
 CellID->1214005476,ExpressionUUID->"68d93067-79a6-be40-529f-18981b59b54c"],

Cell["A driven qubit under continuous measurement", "Subsection",
 CellID->520476813,ExpressionUUID->"63f6a84c-ab1e-4dc1-3ff5-948b9daecfeb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A qubit is driven with Rabi frequency ",
 Cell[BoxData["\[CapitalOmega]"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "00f58272-dded-81c4-459f-83bda5d10e27"],
 ", detuned by ",
 Cell[BoxData["\[CapitalDelta]"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "20034c75-3f2b-a03e-656e-f4f7e78ef8a1"],
 " from its transition, while a detector continuously measures ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "16855d82-4704-4150-22c5-8a9bc8c4d0c1"],
 " at strength ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7d336f15-278e-3072-2588-8c360cac9bf5"],
 " and catches a fraction ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6f8ef5e2-6bda-a42b-0151-9ce80db14ed9"],
 " of the signal. Does watching stop the oscillation?"
}], "Text",
 CellID->2054782259,ExpressionUUID->"6857e158-1707-69b8-2cb5-ee90d0fc4b93"],

