   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "}"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3b0f4997-4082-11ad-6be6-4fe42fbd8c6f"],
 ", the three-qubit state conditioned on the records ",
