  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "03657c9c-1a62-ba6d-0032-9c55a129cabf"],
 "; each outcome of probability above ",
 Cell[BoxData["0.05"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "76d7db99-6b11-4b04-74f7-d8ee0748b2a4"],
 " is labeled with its continued-fraction convergent ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["k", "TI"], "/", 
